{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of distinct points common to the curves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c55187e6b9db57393441aa2f310774530a578513.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+4y^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6a6294795f032d8f09df6948287f7e7e03b0304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2+y^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2eee000b9c81b666feea47e8ac48b1beb4219b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0 \\quad \\text{(B) } 1 \\quad \\text{(C) } 2 \\quad \\text{(D) } 3 \\quad \\text{(E) } 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"266\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2da58a0cb3e2986f17e14c3599833096bcd474d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x^2$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/4/87448f63249cc240676c7a6ca29ea973b83d5db7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" />. \nWe now have a system of 2 linear equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729994feeabffdb8c9d28417d99e5205078a0f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+4b=1\\\\4a+b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"36\" />\nMultiplying the first equation by 4 and then subtracting the second equation from the first one, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d03bae7bf1ee7e76d9eb8fc70dbc0d1c258da29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15b=0\\\\b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"34\" />\nNow, we can substitute b to solve for a:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45c81c895b03cb38982c79c9f9bf224aeb177cae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+0=4\\\\a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"33\" />\nNow note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58dbcfef0c4dfbb2757cbda3ea351d857fd5ea16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=1 \\rightarrow x=\\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20a8f47f80686c16ec831da385ffd4c02ed56de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2=0\\rightarrow y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />, so the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1381ef9d0f0ab761f7871b041cb1d6b8e1050d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,0), (-1, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />. There are two solutions, meaning that the answer is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1